achievement: aller_guten_dinge_sind_zwei

Perhaps surprisingly, Lorne Jarrow has made an unforeseen comeback and won the presidency. We hope that his governance will be an improvement over that of DuFour, and that he continues to keep the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power. 

