Gareth Gesling has made a comeback and won the presidency. Despite his[? if lvp_formed: &nbsp;former?] affiliation with the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Golds**</span>, he isn’t as friendly as his colleagues. However, he is a significant step up from DuFour. Let’s hope he continues to keep the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

