Edmund Askew may be an advocate of economic austerity, but as president, he’s a clear step up from DuFour in both his <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> convictions and his stance toward the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>. Let’s hope he stands firm and keeps the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

