Adam Sedgewick has risen from Free Guild president to President of the Commonwealth. He is expected to pursue friendlier policies toward the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> than DuFour did, and to provide a voice for the laborers of the Commonwealth. Let's hope he remains firm in keeping the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> out of power.

