Unfortunately, Cedric Lethmoor, a <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> not far different from DuFour, has been elected president. A return to government under his leadership—his Camarilla certainly won’t allow it. Let’s hope he holds the line against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> and abandons the dangerous taming strategy.

